This licence covers PalRoute's own source code only.

PalRoute is an unofficial fan tool, not affiliated with or endorsed by
Pocketpair. Palworld and all related assets are the property of Pocketpair.

The base map image under frontend/data/ is community-made fan art, bundled so
the UI has a map to draw on. It is not PalRoute's work and is not licensed
above — see the Credits section of frontend/README.md.

Point-of-interest coordinates are not distributed with this repository. They
are downloaded at build time from third-party sources listed in
backend/data/sources.lock.json, under their own terms — see the Credits section
of backend/README.md.
